   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 2.1. Increased capacity of Member States to ratify international labour standards</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Syria ratified in April 2023 the Maritime Labour convention MLC 2006 which will enter into force in April 2024. The ILO advocated with the Ministery of Labour and Social Affairs and provided training on ILS and guidance to their staff</narrative>
   </description>
